    "description": "Quiet country setting but still close enough to town for all the conveniences. Nice wide and shaded pull through sites. We also have a play ground, fenced dog park, rec room with billiards tables, ping pong, air hockey and of course free wifi. Step out behind the rec room and you'll find our in-ground pool with multiple grills open for use! What better way to cool off on those hot summer days?\n\n**Do not listen to the directions on Google maps when heading southbound! Google will have you drive past us then turn around on a small county road to come back. DON'T DO THIS!! You can turn into the park directly from the highway. We are located on the corner of Hwy 79 and county road 224. Southbound, look for the center turn lane.**",
